<title>UK: London gold closes for four-day Easter weekend.</title>
<headline>London gold closes for four-day Easter weekend.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes at $348.30/$348.80, down just 20 cents in thin volumes. Market reopens on Tuesday, April 1, after long holiday weekend.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ends two cents lower at $5.12/$5.14.</p>
<p>PLATINUM  - Finishes $0.80 down at $371.70/$372.70.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closes $1.50 higher at $146.50/$147.50.</p>
</text>
